  "anatomy_notes": {
    "source": "Existing chr437 dsts-extractor0.9.0 GLB; PMDO10003 verified against local installed manifest read-only.",
    "eyes": "Opt-in source layers: chr437b01 dark eye/face on UV3, chr437p01 iris via UV2 cropped by chr437b01m green. eye_L/R are shine hemispheres: chr437e01h whiteRGB is fallback, alpha holds view-space highlights; alpha-to-RGB matcap with native vertex-alpha and green crop. No invented pupils or Agumon masks. This restores source-backed layering, not full original-game shader equivalence.",
    "head": "Measured bind eye-pair midpoint [0,0.1800644882,0.2037754878] transformed to native J_center local space.",
    "hand_slots": "No arm/leg bones. J_mimi_L/R/B animate three upper spikes. Hand slots instead use inner body-side bind points [+/-0.18,0.15,0.06] relative to J_center; conventions, not anatomical hands. Anatomical left +X is screen-right in Down.",
    "ground": "Native J_root remains at origin; J_center bobs by0.0507 world units with body squash and independently moving spikes. Sampled neutral underside-0.0023 near bind floor0, quarter phases+0.0275,+0.0108,+0.0264: grounded soft-body bob, not sustained flight. Fixed neutral ground placement per direction preserves subsequent native gaps; fixed shadowrow25, no per-frame fitting.",
    "motion": "bn01 duration1.133333s, four quarter-cycle samples at17ticks each. Scale track ends at1.1s with Y scale1.014769 versus0.971765 at start; source seam retained, not procedurally repaired.",
    "pending": "V1 approval withdrawn after source alpha/matcap audit. V2 restores native dark eye opening/iris plus source shine; source body/spikes/scale/motion unchanged. Parent gate required; Idle only.",
    "actions": "96/768/extent1.44 are triple Idle padding at identical pixels/world-unit. Shadow57-center48 equals Idle25-center16=+9. Placement mode airborne is shared fixed-origin implementation only: Punimon remains grounded, no artificial lift. Allframes fixedshift0, source Y/rotation/scale/spikes preserved; J_center XZ travel stabilized only.",
    "sleep": "Native bn02 flattened body breathing with explicitly selected source b01 second-row closed-eye curves (UV3 +0.25V); same shift in green crop mask disables native iris/shine. No painted pupils/lids. Not claiming exported facial animation.",
    "ground_tolerance": "Fixed origin/zero global shift; <=1px exact-black contact outline may cross shadow row. Any source-colored pixels below row require separate review/correction."
